 id=\"w-twbox-intro\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-profile\">\n<div id=\"w-twbox-image\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20221213213444&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;format=original\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tokel_50cce4.gif\"/></div>\n<div id=\"w-twbox-look\"><div class=\"npc-look tibiatext tibiagreen\">You see Tokel.</div></div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hide\" id=\"w-twbox-bubble\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"NPC Bubble D\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"18\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/NPC_Bubble_D_215d07.gif\" width=\"18\"/></span></div>\n<div class=\"\" id=\"w-twbox-sounds\"><span class=\"tibiatext tibiayellow\"><ul class=\"sound-list\"><li>Are you hungry? I offer bread, cheese, ham and meat. Perfect for a little snack.</li></ul></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Greenshore\">Greenshore</a> village.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-notes\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Notes\">Notes</span></h3>\n<p>Tokel is a farmer, and proud of it.\n</p>\n<div class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\" data-seq-no=\"0\" hash=\"fcc72b56334859b0da2bff45e2b6c11e\" id=\"w-gallery-0\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:143px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"w-Tokel-s_house-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:141px; width:185px;\"><img alt=\"Tokel's house\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-caption=\"Tokel's house\" height=\"141\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Tokel_s_house_ae8503.png\" style=\"\" title=\"Tokel's house.png (63 KB)\" width=\"185\"/></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:185px;\">Tokel's house</div></div></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-trades\">\n<h3 class=\"semantic-header\"><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Trade_Details\">Trade Details</span></h3>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-buys\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Buys\">Buys</span></h4><p class=\"no-results\">This NPC does not buy anything.</p></div>\n<div class=\"trades\" id=\"w-npc-trade-sells\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Sells\">Sells</span></h4><table class=\"wikitable sortable\"><tbody><tr><th></th><th>Item</th><th data-sort-type=\"number\">Price</th></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\"><img alt=\"Bread\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Bread_df8535.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Bread\">Bread</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">3 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\"><img alt=\"Cheese\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Cheese_fd71d6.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Cheese\">Cheese</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\"><img alt=\"Ham\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ham_25e33a.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Ham\">Ham</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">8 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr><tr style=\"text-align:center\"><td><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\"><img alt=\"Meat\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"32\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Meat_7cb26b.gif\" width=\"32\"/></a></span></td><td><a href=\"#/wiki/Meat\">Meat</a></td><td style=\"white-space:nowrap\">5 <span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Gold\"><img alt=\"Gold\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Gold_Icon_f66d4c.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-npc-transcripts\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h3>\n<dl><dd><i>To change these transcripts, edit the transcripts page for Tokel.</i></dd></dl>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>hi</b><br/>\n<strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tokel</strong>: Hi there, <i>Player</i>.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>how are you?</b><br/>\nTokel: I am fine, thank you.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>job</b><br/>\nTokel: I am a farmer, and proud of it.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>god</b><br/>\nTokel: I pray to Crunor to bless our harvests.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>king</b><br/>\nTokel: I wish I'd be as rich as him.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>name</b><br/>\nTokel: My name is Tokel.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>tibia</b><br/>\nTokel: I have not seen much of it yet. I am thinking about moving to <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> soon.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Edron</b><br/>\nTokel: They say life is easy there, the soil is rich, the city save. One day I might move there.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Greenshore</b><br/>\nTokel: The soil is a bit dry and there are a lot of stones. It's very hard to work this soil.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>weapon</b>, <b>spell</b> or <b>magic</b><br/>\nTokel: I know nothing but about such stuff.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>dungeons</b><br/>\nTokel: Here are no dungeons as far as I know.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>monsters</b><br/>\nTokel: It's relatively peaceful here.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b><a href=\"#/wiki/Thais\">Thais</a></b><br/>\nTokel: The city is too lousy and crowded for my taste.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>food</b> or <b>offers</b><br/>\nTokel: I can offer you bread, cheese, ham, or meat. If you'd like to see my offers, ask me for a trade.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>trade</b><br/>\nTokel: Of course, just browse through my wares.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>help</b><br/>\nTokel: Sorry, I have no idea how to help you.<br/><br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>time</b><br/>\nTokel: Oh, now that you mention it: I have much left to do, please excuse me.<b><br/></b>\n<i>he stops the conversation</i><br/><br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>bye</b><br/>\nTokel: Bye, <i>Player</i>.</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Tokel</strong></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div>","quests":[],"pos":{"x":32256,"y":32056,"z":7}}